{"id": "biz-4", "headline": "HHS picks 15 groups to test food-as-medicine in Medicare", "source": "STAT", "url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/20/kennedy-food-is-medicine-maha-elevate-pilot/", "published": "2026-11-20", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["HHS announced Friday that 15 groups across the US will test whether nutrition, exercise and other lifestyle programs improve the health of Medicare patients and save the government money, STAT reports. The program, called MAHA ELEVATE, aims to build evidence over the next several years on whether preventive efforts such as cooking classes and nutrition coaching for people with chronic conditions deserve Medicare coverage. Medicare does not cover many such interventions today, even though most of the trillions the US spends on health care goes to treating chronic disease. Source: STAT"], "qr": {"n": 37, "rows": ["1111111011110111011001000010101111111", "1000001000011111000111000000101000001", "1011101001010110000111001111101011101", "1011101000110011010111111110001011101", "1011101000111101010100000000001011101", "1000001001010110000010010100001000001", "1111111010101010101010101010101111111", "0000000011001010001100100110000000000", "1101101001001111110100011001001000001", "0010010011100010001101111001110110010", "0001001101101010011001111011101111111", "1100100110100011010010010001000100100", "0001011100000110000010011010101101011", "1101100010001000000010010011010011110", "0110101110000011000111000011101110011", "0001110010001110101010010001010100101", "1010101000011001000010101101111001111", "0011100110010000011110100101110101000", "1100011011101110110111010011100110001", "0000010100110101100110010101000011001", "1101111011110100111000011011011010011", "0001010110101100111101110011100111110", "1111001101110101010001011001011110101", "1010100111011100110000000010100001111", "0011101100011101100110011001001100001", "1110010110000110000000010011000011010", "1110101101111101001110100011110100011", "1010010010110001